{"id": "tinystories-train-00000003", "text": "Once upon a time, in a land full of trees, there was a little cherry tree. The cherry tree was very sad because it did not have any friends. All the other trees were big and strong, but the cherry tree was small and weak. The cherry tree was envious of the", "split": "train", "source_split": "train", "source_record_index": 3, "source": "roneneldan/TinyStories", "source_revision": "f54c09fd23315a6f9c86f9dc80f725de7d8f9c64", "language": "en", "license": "CDLA-Sharing-1.0", "text_sha256": "45ca01f9f127fc90131888ba763b19adeb1b5984834ae6b897b023aa972453e2", "family": "f06b0e11b38be63f29c665d60b1c0a7f8f4f306d3cadbe4833c392ea4c311ed6", "complete_text_sha256": "45ca01f9f127fc90131888ba763b19adeb1b5984834ae6b897b023aa972453e2"}
{"id": "tinystories-train-00000001", "text": "Once upon a time, there was a little car named Beep. Beep loved to go fast and play in the sun. Beep was a healthy car because he always had good fuel. Good fuel made Beep happy and strong.\nOne day, Beep was driving in the park when he saw a big tree. The ", "split": "train", "source_split": "train", "source_record_index": 1, "source": "roneneldan/TinyStories", "source_revision": "f54c09fd23315a6f9c86f9dc80f725de7d8f9c64", "language": "en", "license": "CDLA-Sharing-1.0", "text_sha256": "2727f32f50da906df9591726a44fdef880bde894b9c8f4e3e4c39bea396d832a", "family": "6c1256c97db8cd0438eeec11532c1c877199cbd7873192f2a5934a5c4f2f26f0", "complete_text_sha256": "2727f32f50da906df9591726a44fdef880bde894b9c8f4e3e4c39bea396d832a"}
{"id": "tinystories-train-00000010", "text": "Once upon a time, there was a big car named Dependable. He had a very important job. Dependable would take a family to the park every day. The family had a mom, dad, and a little girl named Lily. They all had a lot of love for each other.\nOne day, when the", "split": "train", "source_split": "train", "source_record_index": 10, "source": "roneneldan/TinyStories", "source_revision": "f54c09fd23315a6f9c86f9dc80f725de7d8f9c64", "language": "en", "license": "CDLA-Sharing-1.0", "text_sha256": "e294edc0fb47a1e0160dec606427cefdecbad0c0fdaa92a4a7f3b407fd778da6", "family": "e79b30d36e3554b85e1f5194eb6681c4bfd735e24b6ec5f4e82b5b3063bad180", "complete_text_sha256": "e294edc0fb47a1e0160dec606427cefdecbad0c0fdaa92a4a7f3b407fd778da6"}
{"id": "tinystories-train-00000061", "text": "Once upon a time, there was a little girl named Annie. She was only three years old but she was full of energy and liked to explore. One day, she was walking in the forest and came across a clearing. In the middle of the clearing was an arrow. \n Annie was ", "split": "train", "source_split": "train", "source_record_index": 61, "source": "roneneldan/TinyStories", "source_revision": "f54c09fd23315a6f9c86f9dc80f725de7d8f9c64", "language": "en", "license": "CDLA-Sharing-1.0", "text_sha256": "4253a95364c466af71bd03a83b3a111109a8a5e7cbd19eab5cb45f0547ed7694", "family": "3a45b6136b9e81c4175fd6885cacccbcbf534c06119ebb68a6c2205e29ee30fd", "complete_text_sha256": "4253a95364c466af71bd03a83b3a111109a8a5e7cbd19eab5cb45f0547ed7694"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-d12edd29-d467-4b19-b3f5-533fa5c8d56a", "text": "秋夕\n杜牧\n紅燭秋光冷畫屏，輕羅小扇撲流螢。\n天階夜色涼如水，坐看牽牛織女星。", "title": "秋夕", "author": "杜牧", "paragraphs": ["紅燭秋光冷畫屏，輕羅小扇撲流螢。", "天階夜色涼如水，坐看牽牛織女星。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 77, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "d855bbeebee2c451c179dfe59575fb841bbf2ed9fb88ca043c66af21d4a00bbc", "family": "db907f3b640e4215e8059d3cad7b6bc25e581e7cfd56566ecfbfdc328ae99d28", "complete_text_sha256": "d855bbeebee2c451c179dfe59575fb841bbf2ed9fb88ca043c66af21d4a00bbc"}
{"id": "tinystories-train-00000041", "text": "Once upon a time, in a big, green park, there was a small, messy dog named Binky. Binky had a long, waggy tail and loved to play with his friends. One sunny day, Binky and his friends were playing catch with a big, red ball.\nAs they played, Binky's tail go", "split": "train", "source_split": "train", "source_record_index": 41, "source": "roneneldan/TinyStories", "source_revision": "f54c09fd23315a6f9c86f9dc80f725de7d8f9c64", "language": "en", "license": "CDLA-Sharing-1.0", "text_sha256": "9c24d20ae0b230be60beb39aa23ce45b27f6c02a8ed968d0b977355af7c3223e", "family": "6d0c859ca13d8059ddfc237d636fd791390f11af12578d7ae9b488a36b8972a8", "complete_text_sha256": "9c24d20ae0b230be60beb39aa23ce45b27f6c02a8ed968d0b977355af7c3223e"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-91f95b30-c42f-470a-9df8-dd6284fca474", "text": "隋宮\n李商隱\n乘興南遊不戒嚴，九重誰省諫書函。\n春風舉國裁宮錦，半作障泥半作帆。", "title": "隋宮", "author": "李商隱", "paragraphs": ["乘興南遊不戒嚴，九重誰省諫書函。", "春風舉國裁宮錦，半作障泥半作帆。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "七言绝句", "咏史怀古", "讽刺"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 21, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "26147e5f45d69c4108e97d4fb76cbfb57363700265589a23c56eb75507c11090", "family": "ea6c803f78c6f820169116ffdba2c8f7231254cdef88f7e2c51ade5480d007c2", "complete_text_sha256": "26147e5f45d69c4108e97d4fb76cbfb57363700265589a23c56eb75507c11090"}
{"id": "tinystories-train-00000073", "text": "Once upon a time there was a brother and sister who loved to play together. One day they went to the park and saw the most interesting mug. It was big, colourful and looked like it belonged to a magical creature. The brother was very tempted to steal it bu", "split": "train", "source_split": "train", "source_record_index": 73, "source": "roneneldan/TinyStories", "source_revision": "f54c09fd23315a6f9c86f9dc80f725de7d8f9c64", "language": "en", "license": "CDLA-Sharing-1.0", "text_sha256": "1cc2fd31322f4b634c3b7a7ba4b8060987f90035ef40609370be52b010bafd39", "family": "3bc9d660f5f2e69c43e16265f370f9c66b4147c8de65c0c48fb87ac02f23bca1", "complete_text_sha256": "1cc2fd31322f4b634c3b7a7ba4b8060987f90035ef40609370be52b010bafd39"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-4c5b328d-2ab8-4f4d-a0c2-627b6cb0c92b", "text": "金陵圖\n韋莊\n誰謂傷心畫不成，畫人心逐世人情。\n君看六幅南朝事，老木寒雲滿故城。", "title": "金陵圖", "author": "韋莊", "paragraphs": ["誰謂傷心畫不成，畫人心逐世人情。", "君看六幅南朝事，老木寒雲滿故城。"], "tags": ["隋・唐・五代", "唐诗三百首", "题画", "七言绝句", "咏史怀古", "带有地名", "地名"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 35, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "6d481ab4e4e8bb3c85de8839b457002da0fa50fae57d48c8526c0bc9e4d62108", "family": "00f12683c71461fa7409ba7bc6f98aa9250db809ba678a783c0d1c6fb9f7a8b9", "complete_text_sha256": "6d481ab4e4e8bb3c85de8839b457002da0fa50fae57d48c8526c0bc9e4d62108"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-ea3f91f0-487e-4df7-826a-3692ef82e64d", "text": "遣悲懷三首 二\n元稹\n昔日戲言身後意，今朝皆到眼前來。\n衣裳已施行看盡，針線猶存未忍開。\n尚想舊情憐婢僕，也曾因夢送錢財。\n誠知此恨人人有，貧賤夫妻百事哀。", "title": "遣悲懷三首 二", "author": "元稹", "paragraphs": ["昔日戲言身後意，今朝皆到眼前來。", "衣裳已施行看盡，針線猶存未忍開。", "尚想舊情憐婢僕，也曾因夢送錢財。", "誠知此恨人人有，貧賤夫妻百事哀。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "思念", "追忆", "悼亡", "七言律诗"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 44, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "f91cc15904211dace8885fdbb07d1dd80968850ee204335ec79eec999a001a11", "family": "59f1e366e0fa4595474ad5e10dd6be1418c5adac365ca1e03cbad273c22876ba", "complete_text_sha256": "f91cc15904211dace8885fdbb07d1dd80968850ee204335ec79eec999a001a11"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-92ae04dc-89af-45d6-9e31-204a01df801d", "text": "遣懷\n杜牧\n落魄江南載酒行，楚腰腸斷掌中輕。\n十年一覺揚州夢，贏得青樓薄倖名。", "title": "遣懷", "author": "杜牧", "paragraphs": ["落魄江南載酒行，楚腰腸斷掌中輕。", "十年一覺揚州夢，贏得青樓薄倖名。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "七言绝句", "抒怀"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 76, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "7f1951f445fbf91e2dabbe61e6274ba1de2d93606db94049ff9ef1ea258dbcb1", "family": "c757751ac3e7b56a18ad0b4ca731da621abbbd352f908a319d91ef3a620a4a61", "complete_text_sha256": "7f1951f445fbf91e2dabbe61e6274ba1de2d93606db94049ff9ef1ea258dbcb1"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-b6475dea-1d69-4f0d-b98a-39393f47741e", "text": "無題二首 二\n李商隱\n重帷深下莫愁堂，臥後清宵細細長。\n神女生涯原是夢，小姑居處本無郎。\n風波不信菱枝弱，月露誰教桂葉香。\n直道相思了無益，未妨惆悵是清狂。", "title": "無題二首 二", "author": "李商隱", "paragraphs": ["重帷深下莫愁堂，臥後清宵細細長。", "神女生涯原是夢，小姑居處本無郎。", "風波不信菱枝弱，月露誰教桂葉香。", "直道相思了無益，未妨惆悵是清狂。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "思念", "七言律诗", "抒情", "爱情"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 29, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "f847b38a9d7dfb6699ec54c7959ae1b45634debab1b7b32f530a209b415ca415", "family": "97c70ee7ece34a12abb13b97ea20c499ed48b73926c20e407d2f524a27167d22", "complete_text_sha256": "f847b38a9d7dfb6699ec54c7959ae1b45634debab1b7b32f530a209b415ca415"}
{"id": "tinystories-train-00000082", "text": "Once upon a time, there lived a little girl called Lucy. One day, Lucy was feeling very sad. She wanted to fly away so she could be happy but she was too young. \nThen, a bright flame appeared in the sky. She was scared at first, but then she saw that the f", "split": "train", "source_split": "train", "source_record_index": 82, "source": "roneneldan/TinyStories", "source_revision": "f54c09fd23315a6f9c86f9dc80f725de7d8f9c64", "language": "en", "license": "CDLA-Sharing-1.0", "text_sha256": "ad0e31964de3cd19ed62299fae9a7882d9fd0f7b9bb23c1345ed6df37f1eaa1e", "family": "4880dc63731bc961fbb9bbb4ae6af9028eb1ce7bcc1d3a52601288e8984b2c61", "complete_text_sha256": "ad0e31964de3cd19ed62299fae9a7882d9fd0f7b9bb23c1345ed6df37f1eaa1e"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-d755f74b-18fd-44d1-a6e1-43e77490bb09", "text": "喜見外弟又言別\n李益\n十年離亂後，長大一相逢。\n問姓驚初見，稱名憶舊容。\n別來滄海事，語罷暮天鐘。\n明日巴陵道，秋山又幾重。", "title": "喜見外弟又言別", "author": "李益", "paragraphs": ["十年離亂後，長大一相逢。", "問姓驚初見，稱名憶舊容。", "別來滄海事，語罷暮天鐘。", "明日巴陵道，秋山又幾重。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "离别", "五言律诗"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 86, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "13e0bd7e9eb7749bfa882b93f9b97426e9f209800755dc091ec06c7934feb524", "family": "8dbaf14f2724a59c802d341e5922cfab694004721b8d0c4bcc98f0ef0939afb7", "complete_text_sha256": "13e0bd7e9eb7749bfa882b93f9b97426e9f209800755dc091ec06c7934feb524"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-fedb06cc-37da-4aaf-8f39-85ebcb08b947", "text": "早秋三首 一\n許渾\n遙夜泛清瑟，西風生翠蘿。\n殘螢委玉露，早鴈拂銀河。\n高樹曉還密，遠山晴更多。\n淮南一葉下，自覺老煙波。", "title": "早秋三首 一", "author": "許渾", "paragraphs": ["遙夜泛清瑟，西風生翠蘿。", "殘螢委玉露，早鴈拂銀河。", "高樹曉還密，遠山晴更多。", "淮南一葉下，自覺老煙波。"], "tags": ["写景", "秋天", "唐诗三百首", "五言律诗"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 80, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "bdeb29a9f72c2696fdb2da2bcc068a9e845a5a20f35cd4db023e9350b775e592", "family": "eeeac91ba7c3e9c9de9f00160e209aa219d205b65b079b7e126d5ab43f887fa0", "complete_text_sha256": "bdeb29a9f72c2696fdb2da2bcc068a9e845a5a20f35cd4db023e9350b775e592"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-72aab9ef-65a9-4a8a-b36b-61932c09ce85", "text": "聽彈琴\n劉長卿\n泠泠七絲上，靜聽松風寒。\n古調雖自愛，今人多不彈。", "title": "聽彈琴", "author": "劉長卿", "paragraphs": ["泠泠七絲上，靜聽松風寒。", "古調雖自愛，今人多不彈。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "抒情", "音乐", "五言绝句"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 93, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "57ffdbd868e8663dc3f0d7112dddb3ccee05ccea1187d604223678bd9ad034fa", "family": "de0bd72150d96221f750b05a41f84f6b115bf30c9dafe1e00d3697a73be4e11b", "complete_text_sha256": "57ffdbd868e8663dc3f0d7112dddb3ccee05ccea1187d604223678bd9ad034fa"}
{"id": "tinystories-train-00000048", "text": "Once upon a time, there was a little infant named Tim. He liked to play with his toys and watch the birds outside his window. Tim had a big, soft teddy bear that he loved very much.\nOne day, Tim's teddy bear was sad. Tim did not know why his teddy bear was", "split": "train", "source_split": "train", "source_record_index": 48, "source": "roneneldan/TinyStories", "source_revision": "f54c09fd23315a6f9c86f9dc80f725de7d8f9c64", "language": "en", "license": "CDLA-Sharing-1.0", "text_sha256": "e4dfdda403b47310f56c946abbe843ea440506e696ba752a435f1eb26c66e98b", "family": "45c12dafbafe8ac8ab0a160300bc7c97e01087f0ce1d9c08aa32995dd7f78274", "complete_text_sha256": "e4dfdda403b47310f56c946abbe843ea440506e696ba752a435f1eb26c66e98b"}
{"id": "tinystories-train-00000011", "text": "Once upon a time, there was a boy named Tim. He liked to wear a big, dark hat. The hat was his favorite thing to wear. Tim wore the hat everywhere he went.\nOne day, Tim found a pencil on the ground. The pencil was small and yellow. Tim liked the pencil a l", "split": "train", "source_split": "train", "source_record_index": 11, "source": "roneneldan/TinyStories", "source_revision": "f54c09fd23315a6f9c86f9dc80f725de7d8f9c64", "language": "en", "license": "CDLA-Sharing-1.0", "text_sha256": "db5ca2b34bd768f0c98f568d5dbe478b555737adb622df7575fade4ab90ca72e", "family": "c145a9443d8bab3a4ba8550cf963445d46c9a2283a347d9ed83c21d03430f757", "complete_text_sha256": "db5ca2b34bd768f0c98f568d5dbe478b555737adb622df7575fade4ab90ca72e"}
{"id": "tinystories-train-00000035", "text": "Once upon a time, there was a big gray elephant named Elly. Elly was sad because she thought she was ugly. She had big ears and a long nose, and she felt different from the other animals.\nOne day, a little bird named Benny flew to Elly. Benny saw that Elly", "split": "train", "source_split": "train", "source_record_index": 35, "source": "roneneldan/TinyStories", "source_revision": "f54c09fd23315a6f9c86f9dc80f725de7d8f9c64", "language": "en", "license": "CDLA-Sharing-1.0", "text_sha256": "41139040e9be6965609567899ed58614bbffdeae6867bf424949e2cbcce43914", "family": "f8d458b006b5ba2d468d947b3ad36cdedab8891f7adba9bbf658c6553a4579af", "complete_text_sha256": "41139040e9be6965609567899ed58614bbffdeae6867bf424949e2cbcce43914"}
